{
  "info": {
    "name": "Instacompay Gateway API (v1)",
    "description": "Instacompay Gateway — collections & disbursements over Zambian mobile money (ZMW).\n\n## Set up (30 seconds)\nOpen the collection's **Variables** tab and paste:\n- `apiKey`    — e.g. ic_sand_… (Merchant Portal → API Documentation)\n- `apiSecret` — shown once when you generate/regenerate a key\n- `accountId` — your account id\n\nThen press **Send**. That's it — no signing, no scripts.\n\n## Auth\nEvery request carries two headers:\n\n    X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}\n    X-Api-Secret: {{apiSecret}}\n\n(You can send `Authorization: Bearer <secret>` instead of `X-Api-Secret` if you prefer.)\n\nHMAC request signing is also supported for higher-security integrations — see the Public API guide at https://merchants.instacompayzm.com/partners.\n\n## Money\nAll amounts are **integer ngwee, as strings**: K1.50 = \"150\", K50.00 = \"5000\". Never decimals.\n\n## Sandbox\nStart with a sandbox key (`ic_sand_…`). Sandbox simulates and settles instantly — no real money, no float used — so you can test the full PROCESSING → SUCCESS lifecycle.\n\n`Idempotency-Key` is set automatically to a fresh GUID on every write; reuse the same value to safely retry a request.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Remember the last transaction id so the status / reverse requests",
          "// work with no copy-paste.",
          "try {",
          "  var b = pm.response.json();",
          "  if (b && b.id) { pm.collectionVariables.set('txnId', b.id); }",
          "} catch (e) { /* non-JSON response */ }"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "https://api.instacompayzm.com", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "apiKey", "value": "ic_sand_replace_me", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "apiSecret", "value": "sk_replace_me", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "accountId", "value": "replace_with_your_account_id", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "msisdn", "value": "260970000001", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "txnId", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Create collection (customer → you)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "X-Api-Key", "value": "{{apiKey}}" },
          { "key": "X-Api-Secret", "value": "{{apiSecret}}" },
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" }
        ],
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/collections", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["v1", "collections"] },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"processor\": \"AIRTEL\",\n  \"amount\": \"5000\",\n  \"msisdn\": \"{{msisdn}}\",\n  \"collectionReference\": \"order-1001\"\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        },
        "description": "Charge a customer's mobile-money wallet. amount is ngwee (\"5000\" = K50.00). processor: AIRTEL | MTN.\n\nProduction prompts the customer's phone and returns PROCESSING — poll the status endpoint until SUCCESS. Sandbox settles instantly."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Create disbursement (you → customer)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "X-Api-Key", "value": "{{apiKey}}" },
          { "key": "X-Api-Secret", "value": "{{apiSecret}}" },
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" }
        ],
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/disbursements", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["v1", "disbursements"] },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"processor\": \"AIRTEL\",\n  \"amount\": \"5000\",\n  \"msisdn\": \"{{msisdn}}\",\n  \"collectionReference\": \"payout-2001\"\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        },
        "description": "Send money to a customer's wallet. msisdn is required (12-digit, e.g. 260970000001). Dispatches to the rail immediately."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Get transaction status",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          { "key": "X-Api-Key", "value": "{{apiKey}}" },
          { "key": "X-Api-Secret", "value": "{{apiSecret}}" }
        ],
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/transactions/{{txnId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["v1", "transactions", "{{txnId}}"] },
        "description": "Status of any transaction — collection or disbursement. txnId is auto-filled from the last create call. Re-enquires the rail on read.\n\nPROCESSING → SUCCESS | FAILED."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Reverse transaction",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "X-Api-Key", "value": "{{apiKey}}" },
          { "key": "X-Api-Secret", "value": "{{apiSecret}}" },
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" }
        ],
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/transactions/{{txnId}}/reverse", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["v1", "transactions", "{{txnId}}", "reverse"] },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"reason\": \"customer refund\"\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        },
        "description": "Reverse a SUCCESS transaction."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Get account balance",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          { "key": "X-Api-Key", "value": "{{apiKey}}" },
          { "key": "X-Api-Secret", "value": "{{apiSecret}}" }
        ],
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/accounts/{{accountId}}/balance", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["v1", "accounts", "{{accountId}}", "balance"] },
        "description": "Float / balance enquiry for your account. Balance is ngwee."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "List settlements",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          { "key": "X-Api-Key", "value": "{{apiKey}}" },
          { "key": "X-Api-Secret", "value": "{{apiSecret}}" }
        ],
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/settlements", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["v1", "settlements"] },
        "description": "Settlements for the account behind the api key."
      }
    }
  ]
}
